quartzfire-content-filtering (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: e2guardian ICAP-server content filtering behind the
    SSL-inspection Squid bump. `service content-filtering` config tree, filter
    groups (source-IP mapping), UT1 category filtering with custom allow/block
    lists, phrase filtering, safe search, block-page, blocklist updater, and
    the qfcf multi-call binary (conf-mode owner + updater + status + test-url).

